        "content": "Just came across Volt (volt.qmatus.com) \u2013 they're pitching 'Git for your work' and replacing hourly timesheets with non-linear mathematical weightage (C^1.4 * I * E). <5ms CLI with local SQLite queue, MCP server, and team bonus pools. Is hourly tracking finally dead, or is this too radical for normal teams?"
